    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "TDeh9SPf2tLg"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### Geometric interpretation of tensor operations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "bPDw_pQ62tLg"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### A geometric interpretation of deep learning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1C9fp6bB2tLg"
      },
      "source": [
        "### The engine of neural networks: Gradient-based optimization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5IAcVG832tLg"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### What's a derivative?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "g3bTOfmH2tLg"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### Derivative of a tensor operation: The gradient"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Pu6W3O742tLg"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### Stochastic gradient descent"
